あれやこれや言いますが
Though the things I say might not make sense

130
00:15:31,004 --> 00:15:33,824
どうか探し続けてみせて
Please, go and find me

131
00:15:34,074 --> 00:15:35,824
ウソと本音の間
In the space between truth and lies

132
00:15:36,124 --> 00:15:38,224
うまく隠しといたんだ
I am hidden away

133
